    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        From Legacy Fortran to Portable Kokkos: An Autonomous <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> AI Workflow
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gupta%2C+S">Sparsh Gupta</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kamalakkannan%2C+K">Kamalavasan Kamalakkannan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Moraru%2C+M">Maxim Moraru</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shipman%2C+G">Galen Shipman</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Diehl%2C+P">Patrick Diehl</a>
      
